n intensifies, the Canadian dollar seems be at least temporarily doffing its petro-\f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  role and re-assuming its old identity as a risk sensitive unit. (don.curren@dowjones.com)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Call us at (212) 416-2326 or email patrick.sullivan@dowjones.com\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Visit the Market Talk blog at \f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.djnmarkettalk.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 www.djnmarkettalk.com}}}\uc2 \f2  [ 03-16-11 1716ET ]\f28 \par \par \uc2 4022   \par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020110316e73g000cr\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
