\par\par \b \uc2 WORLD  \highlight22\uc2 FOREX \highlight\uc2 : Dollar Hits Lowest Ever Vs Yen On Japan Nuclear Fears\b0\par\par\uc2 By Andrew J. Johnson   \par \uc2 Of DOW JONES NEWSWIRES   \par \uc2 796 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2011\par 22:08\par \uc2 Dow Jones Capital Markets Report\par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2011 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 NEW YORK (Dow Jones)--The dollar hit its weakest ever level against the yen Wednesday, as Japan's unfolding nuclear crisis prompted speculators to bet that heavy repatriation flows will likely be needed to respond to a deepening disaster.\par \par \uc2 Overall, safe-haven \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 --paradoxically including the yen--soared in extremely volatile trading as traders took in new warnings about possible catastrophic events at Japan's crippled nuclear power plant.\par \par \uc2 The dollar fell as low as Y79.22 according to EBS via CQG, falling below its previous low of Y79.75, hit in April 1995. The dramatic move prompted traders to warn that the likelihood of \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  to curb yen strength had increased sharply.\par \par \uc2 Traders responded en masse to dire warnings from U.S. Energy Secretary Steven Chu who said he believed a "partial meltdown" occurred at the Japanese nuclear power plant damaged by explosions, malfunctions and radiation leaks following the earthquake.\par \par \uc2 Chu added, however, that Japan's Fukushima Daiichi nuclear power plant has containment systems to prevent leaks and that a partial meltdown doesn't mean the "containment systems will fail."\par \par \uc2 "That [caused] a bit of panic," said Paresh Upadhyaya, head of Americas G10 \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategy at \uc2 Bank of America\uc2 Merrill Lynch\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the European Union's energy chief warned Wednesday that the events at Japan's nuclear plant could be "catastrophic." In introductory remarks to the European Parliament's environment committee, Guenther Oettinger, commissioner for energy, called the situation at Japan's Fukushima Daiichi plant "out of control."\par \par \uc2 After that news, the euro began tumbling against the dollar and yen, continuing a broad risk aversion theme.\par \par \uc2 A Portugal credit downgrade late Tuesday and soft bond auction earlier in the session though also gave traders more reasons to shed aggressive recent pro-euro positions, said Mark McCormick, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist with \uc2 Brown Brothers Harriman\uc2  in New York.\par \par \uc2 EUR1 billion of 12-month Treasury bills were sold at significantly higher yields than two weeks ago--a result that will do nothing to damp market expectations that the country will need a financial bailout soon.\par \par \uc2 The higher funding rate was widely expected after Moody's Investors Service Inc. Tuesday downgraded the country's rating by two notches to A3, citing Portugal's subdued growth prospects and implementation risks for the government's fiscal plans.\par \par \uc2 "The crisis is far from being resolved in the euro zone, and you still have periphery concerns in the euro zone," he said.\par \par \uc2 Late Wednesday, the euro was at $1.3896 from about $1.4000 late Tuesday, according to EBS via CQG. The dollar was at Y79.62 from Y80.72, while the euro was at Y110.67 from Y113.00. The U.K. pound was at $1.6018 from $1.6088. The dollar was at CHF0.9082 from CHF0.9164.\par \par \uc2 The ICE Dollar Index, which tracks the U.S. dollar against a trade-weighted basket of \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , was at 76.621 from about 76.328.\par \par \uc2 Late in the session, \uc2 Tokyo Electric Power Co\uc2 . (9501.TO) said it was close to completing a new power line that could restore electricity to the damaged Fukushima Daiichi nuclear power complex and possibly avert a meltdown, the Associated Press reported Wednesday, citing company spokesman Naoki Tsunoda.\par \par \uc2 But the company said it couldn't confirm progress of the power line.\par \par \uc2 Investors took the opportunity to push the dollar lower against the yen, before fears of possible \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  helped the dollar bounce temporarily back up.\par \par \uc2 Yet even at such strong levels for the yen, some analysts thought \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  might wait before stepping into \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets.\par \par \uc2 "Having \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  unsuccessfully in the yen last year, the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  and \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  know that \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rarely works unless it is coordinated with other central banks," said Kathy Lien, director of \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  research at GFT \b \highlight22\uc2 Forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  in New York.\par \par \uc2 Japanese authorities have found that yen repatriations by life insurers in the wake of the Sendai earthquake and tsunami have so far been relatively negligible, inconsistent with rumors of large-scale fund flows, according to people familiar with these conclusions.\par \par \uc2 Traders believe the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  is more likely to buy dollars if it regards the yen-buying in the post-quake period as speculative rather than based on actual repatriation flows.\par \par \uc2 But the U.S. and Europe are unlikely to coordinate a \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to aid \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's battered economy because the country currently has enough cash firepower, former U.S. Federal Reserve officials say.\par \par \uc2 -By Andrew J. Johnson, Dow Jones Newswires; 212-416-3092; andrewj.johnson@dowjones.com\par \par \uc2 --Takashi Nakamichi contributed to this article. [ 03-16-11 1708ET ]\par \par \uc2 1033 1074 1158 1863 1865 20714 28038 4164   \par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020110316e73g000ck\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
